COMMENT ON TRIGGER log_change ON kodiak.countries IS 'What: AFTER INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE trigger on all tables except audit_logs. Why: Captures successful changes without application code manually inserting generic audit records. How: Calls log_change once per row; its audit entry rolls back if the enclosing transaction rolls back.';
